window.products.push({"id":953065,"name":"Suomi Personal Blender for Shakes and Smoothies with rechargeable USB blender cup, Portable Blender (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zsh0QW0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the ultimate portable blender for your on-the-go lifestyle! To help you get started, we've put together some first-time tips that will ensure you have a smooth experience:  1. Charge it up: When you receive the juicer, make sure to charge it for 3-5 hours first. You'll know it's charging normally when the light on the charger lights up like breathing. Once fully charged, the indicator light will stay on. If the light isn't on, make sure the charger is making good contact with the bottle.  2. Clean and prep the bottle: After it's fully charged, clean the bottle and add your cut fruit along with an appropriate amount of water or milk. Tighten the bottle lid and base, and double-click the button at the bottom to turn on the machine. If the button flashes red, it means the lid or base isn't tightened properly. Tighten it up and try again.  3. Start blending: Press the button once to start the machine, and apply force evenly to avoid collapsing the button. If the button does collapse, try pressing it multiple times in different positions to restore it.  4. Charge it right: Our juicer has a magnetic charger, so make sure the magnetic suction points are completely matched when charging. It normally needs 3-5 hours to charge fully, and a shorter charging time will result in a shorter usage time.  Product specifications:   Product Size: 3.23X3.23X8.59 inch Product Weight: 490g Bottle Capacity: 350ml Bottle Shell Material: Food Grade ABS Charging Time: About 3-5 Hours Full charged using time: 8-10 Times Battery Capacity: 1400mAh 7.4V  Enjoy the convenience of our portable fruit juicer and make healthy living a breeze!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zsh0QW0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suomi","source_asin":"B0BQFVGNYS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQFVGNYS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQFVGNYS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
