window.products.push({"id":953162,"name":"Lake Livingston Texas Map Canvas Throw Pillow for Couch or Sofa at Home & Office by Lakebound 13\" x 19\".","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-AEiL561L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This work of art is by the artists at Lakebound. Many people have strong and lasting memories of fun holidays and vacations at the lake or on the coast. Summers learning to water ski, swim, sleep-away camp, cliff jumping, time at the cabin, the smell of shady coves and bays, the lazy days melting into warm evenings, and fall after the crowds leave. There is something about the being on the water that is like nowhere else. Lakebound classic vintage maps are geographically accurate and bring a little lake or coastal magic to you and the walls of your home or office. Distinctive and unusual canvas sofa or couch throw pillow is decorated with an original work of art created by an award-winning artist. Each artist has a unique style and vision that distinctively captures the personality and life of the setting and location. All throw pillows are professionally printed and assembled in USA on high-quality synthetic canvas. Fabric dyed with UL Certified GREENGUARD GOLD inks that produces vibrant color true to the artist’s vision and original creation while having low VOC (volatile organic compounds), preventing off-gassing and making the pillow odor-free out of the box. This throw pillow is the perfect design accent to your kitchen, bedroom, family room, office, or even dorm room décor. Discover exclusive, American-made and designed wall art of beautiful and popular destinations, pop culture, photography, abstract subjects and much more from Northwest Art Mall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-AEiL561L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art of Place","source_asin":"B09LM1VWVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LM1VWVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LM1VWVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953163,"name":"Personalized Flask for Women Hot Pink Glitter Custom 5 oz Stainless Steel Wine Alcohol Whiskey Hidden Bachelorette Party Favor with Custom Rhinestone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81svXPIu0hL._AC_SL1330_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY : These Liquor Flasks are made from durable food grade stainless steel, with a sparkling rhinestone crystal cap top. Lightweight, yet sturdy, this hidden shot flask can be taken anywhere. TOP QUALITY - These Stainless Steel Flasks are made from durable stainless steel, more specifically Premium 304 18/8 Food Grade Stainless Steel, whereas other Flasks from other stores may use a cheaper, lower quality Steel. So know that you are receiving the best of the best! KEPT HOT OR COLD - These Stainless Steel Flasks have vacuum insulated walls that can keep ice cool for up to 24 HRS, or keep beverages like coffee hot for up to 6 HRS. And you’ll never have to worry about your drink being overly freezing or overly scalding to touch! Because of their insulators, our cups are kept at a cool, comfortable temperature. THE PERFECT GIFT - This Flask makes the perfect gifts for birthdays, Christmas, Mothers Day, Anniversary. It is perfect to gift to a wife, daughter, grandma, Best Friend, Coworker, or any other women in your life such as niece, aunt, Nana, teacher, or sister in law. This funny, insulated, stainless steel Flask for women will surly be a hit. 100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION - We have spent quality time working hands on with these items putting them to the test to assure customer satisfaction. However, if for any reason you are not completely satisfied with your stainless steel tumbler, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will work together to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81svXPIu0hL._AC_SL1330_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuptify","source_asin":"B0916M2F42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916M2F42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916M2F42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953164,"name":"How Plum Bear Lodge Elk Rustic Twin Comforter 6 Piece Bedding and Deer Sheet Set Cabin Hunting Bed in a Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KCjIIKZ0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add rustic style to your bedroom with this twin size comforter and sheet bedding set. This 6 piece bed in a bag set includes everything needed for a bedroom makeover, including a comforter, sham, microfiber sheets and a decorative embroidered pillow. Rich brown and green earth tones meet bold red accents in this woodsy bedding set. Bears, deer, evergreen trees and plaid patterns decorate the comforter and shams. You’ll find the red carried over into the sheet set for a coordinating look. These patterns are perfect for lodge or cabin themed rooms. The set comfortably fits single beds. Bed in a Bag Set Includes: Twin Comforter: 66” x 86” (1), Pillow Sham: 20” x 26” + 2” (1), Decorative Pillow: 16” x 16” (1), Flat Sheet: 66” x 96” + 4” (1), Fitted Sheet: 39” x 75” + 10” (1), and Pillowcase: 20” x 30” + 4” (1).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KCjIIKZ0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"How Plum","source_asin":"B09QBGC16Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QBGC16Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QBGC16Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953165,"name":"Srenta 16-Ounce Clear Insulated Tumblers with Lids | Great Iced Coffee Cup, Tea Cup, & Wine Tumbler with Lid for Home & Travel | Made From Tritan Plas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x5PP7EkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➙ SUITABLE FOR HOT AND COLD DRINKS: This multi-purpose, sweatproof and insulated cup is great for home and restaurants. Use them for practically any drink, hot or cold. They’re excellent as champagne glasses, cocktail glasses and iced coffee tumbler, while traveling, walking or driving. ➙ DURABLE AND ULTRA-SAFE PLASTIC: Our clear cups with lids are better than traditional plastic cups, stainless steel and glass. These clear tumblers with lid are made from premium Tritan plastic that won’t scratch, crack, condensate or leak. Contains NO BPA or BPS. Package includes: 4 cups and 4 lids. ➙ SPILL PROOF & SPLASH RESISTANT: Be confident that wherever you take this sleek clear coffee mug, your drink stays securely in the cup and outside dust stays out. Even if it is turned upside down or to the side, it will not leak! Rotate The swivel plug feature for convenient sipping or straw drinking. ➙ HOLDS UP GREAT IN THE DISHWASHER: You can safely wash the clear cups with lids on the top rack of the dishwasher without worrying about them melting or warping. Our clear tumbler is microwaveable. However, do not microwave the cover. The lids easily remove and slide on to refill or washing. ➙ HELP US SUPPORT LOCAL INDUSTRIES: At Srenta, we believe in supporting our local economy. All of our drinkware sets are made in the USA. They come with a One Year Free Replacement Warranty and 30-Day Money Back Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71x5PP7EkuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Srenta","source_asin":"B09LRB9SQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRB9SQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRB9SQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
