window.products.push({"id":953274,"name":"HOME-X Set of 2 Microwavable Pig Lids, Cute Silicone Piggy Covers, Splatter Guards, Useful Kitchen Gadgets, Set of 2, 1 Small 6/8” D and 1 Large 8 3/8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QwOtsMoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to messy microwaves when you use our set of 2 splatter guards. These splatter shields will effectively prevent splashes, spills, and messes by covering up your containers while you microwave them. No longer do you need to wipe down salsa, sauce, or soup in your microwave. Plus, these lids are made to look like cute little pigs. The pig face is in the middle, complete with ears and a snout. You can use the pig head as a grip for when you want to remove the cover. These reusable covers also comes in a sweet pink color that will complement most interior design and themes. This set of 2 splatter shields are made from flexible, durable BPA Free silicone, so it will last for years. These covers are both microwave- and dishwasher-safe. Just be sure to put it on the top rack of the dishwasher. You can get this cover set as a present for a pig lover. They will love the fun design. You can also gift them to a chef, cook, or homemaker. They’ll appreciate your cute yet useful gift. This set of 2 pig-themed screens come with two sizes, the small measures 6 7/8\" D x 1\" H and the large measures 8 3/8\" D x 1\" H. This set will fit on most round containers and bowls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QwOtsMoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B09XJ9ZK1R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XJ9ZK1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XJ9ZK1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953275,"name":"Renditions Gallery Gracie the Bulldog Wall Art, Tired and Bored Dog, Black & White Sketch Artwork, Premium Gallery Wrapped Canvas, Ready to Hang, 18 I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gf-z4s24L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Materials: Printed Premium Canvas, Solid Wood Stretcher Quality Art: Our in-house production and design team are constantly checking the quality and detail of the artwork we provide to ensure an exceptionally produced product for your home and style. This canvas print features a frameless, gallery wrap, production method where the canvas is stretched around the sides of a solid wood frame. Purchase these prints in multiples and place them in different rooms to bring a cohesive theme to your home decorating. Made to Order: Your art is made to order and made in the USA. This design is Giclee printed on premium canvas, professionally hand-made and ready to hang. Giclee is an advanced printmaking process for creating high-quality fine art reproductions. It is UV resistant, fade resistant and water resistant. Ready to Hang: Each print comes fully assembled and ready to hang. You need only to apply and anchor to the wall of your choice. Please measure your wall to get the best size that fits your space. These prints can be easily cleaned by using either a feather duster or a clean, soft, dry cloth. *Due to monitor variations, actual wall art colors may be slightly different from the product image. * Range of Sizes and Themes: If it can fit in a frame it can go on your wall. We have an ever-growing catalog of artwork for you to choose from and offer a variety of sizes to fit your exact space. From large to small and options in between. We offer a nice selection of sizes. Whether you are looking for a new piece to greet you at your entryway, something to proudly display in your office, or some new art to adorn your bedroom wall, we have just the print for you. A Perfect Gift: Treat yourself or someone your care for. Artwork is a great gift idea for holidays, birthdays, anniversaries, graduations, or just because. Give a gift that will be a reminder of you. Art can be placed anywhere no matter the size of the home, apartment, dorm, or office and can be displayed in just as many places, from the kitchen, to a bathroom, living room, hallway, and more. Decorate a wall with something worth looking at.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gf-z4s24L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Renditions Gallery","source_asin":"B08FRKTCW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FRKTCW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FRKTCW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
