window.products.push({"id":953493,"name":"MKLZ Wood Salt and Pepper Grinder, 6 Inch Wooden Adjustable Manual Spice Crack Mill, Refillable Salted Grinding Shakers with Ceramic Rotor for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sQvu5DCWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"grinding mechanism offers outstanding strength.Enables you to instantly adjust grinding consistency from fine to coarse by rotating the top nut.Simple to refill. non-corrosive and ceramic pepper grinder that won't absorb flavors or odors. The ergonomic design makes the spice grinder comfortable to hold. Just turn it on or off to use it easily. The wide-mouth design allows you to easily add spices. A cap on a pepper grinder serves several purposes. It keeps the pepper dry and fresh, increases the overall beauty, and restricts the pepper at your counter and anywhere else (party, camping,travel,picnic or other party).A sleek affordable pepper grinder mill that is perfect for all types of peppercorn. If a peppercorn or other spice seed becomes trapped in the grinder gears, turn it upside-down and gently tap the bottom.If that doesn't free it, you should be able to work it free using a soft cloth or toothpick. the cleaning method:To clean a grinder, wipe it down on the outside with a damp cloth and on the inside with a dry, soft cloth.If the inside does somehow become exposed to water, allow it to dry completely before refilling it with peppercorns. size:6.41 inches long and 2.04 inches wide Quantity: 1x Pepper Grinder About dimensions: All dimensions are manually measured with slight errors. About chromatic aberration: Products are shot in kind. Due to objective external factors such as light, angle, and display, certain visual chromatic aberrations may be caused. If you have any questions about our products, you can send us an email and we will contact you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sQvu5DCWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MKLZ","source_asin":"B0892GQBML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892GQBML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892GQBML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
