window.products.push({"id":953496,"name":"Christmas Decoration LED String Lights, Dimmable Creative 3D Twinkle Hanging Lights with Timer/5 Modes/USB Plug,Warm White Remote Control Curtain Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IdzAn9p8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Creative 3D Acrylic & Warm Glow Design】LOFTER led string lights made of 6pcs high-quality transparent acrylic plate, and the christmas themed pattern adopts laser engraving technology to make the scene with clear texture, smooth lines. Soft leds glow warm white lighting, create a lively three dimensional feeling, it will add an element of fun to your holiday display and get your home ready for Christmas. 【5 Different Working Modes for You】This christmas hanging lights offer 5 different working modes (Stays ON, Flashing at a Uniform Speed, Fast & Slow Flashing, Gradual Brightness Change and Combine the previous 4 modes). It also has 10 different brightness levels and 4 different flashing speeds, enable you to personalize the decor lighting according to your different needs. 【2 Control Methods & USB Powered】Easy to control the 3D twinkle lights by 2 methods- Remote Control and Push Button Control. Sensitive remote allows to work well from long distance control, and when the remote is not around you, you also can control it by press the push button on the USB plug. Insert the USB cable to power adapter, power bank or other USB devices to power the lamp easily. ( Note: It only comes with USB plug, adapter not included.) 【Smart Timing & Memory Feature】After turning on our warm white curtain lights, press the \"Timer\" button and you will see the light flash 2 times, it is now setting the timing function successfully and it will auto turn off after 6 hours, you can cancel the timing function by press the \"Timer\" button again and the light will flash 4 times. Smart memory function can help your string lights to turn on again for the next 24 hour cycle, don't need to manually turn it on. 【Easy Installation & Perfect Christmas Gift】Equipped 6pcs removable hooks, very easy to hang it to anywhere you want, no any tool required, such as curtains, ropes, nails and so on. This beautiful and unique fairy lights is a perfect christmas gift, it can use to decorate kitchen/dinning room's window, fireplace, mantel, wall, bedroom during Christmas Holidays. Be prepared to receive numerous compliments for it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IdzAn9p8L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOFTER","source_asin":"B08D3BKW3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D3BKW3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D3BKW3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
