window.products.push({"id":953588,"name":"Vorceary Adhesive Hat Hooks for Wall (10-Pack) - Minimalist Hat Rack Design, Strong and no Drilling, Hat Shelf Organizer for Baseball Hats for Door, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718faeDZ9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Conceal design】： The hat rack uses conceal design. When you put your hat on the hat rack, it will be hidden under the hat that shows the hat only. 【Strong stickiness】：The hat rack is made of high-quality acrylic and is firm for the strong glue. The maximum load of the hat rack is 3 pounds, but there is different bonding effect on different walls. It is recommended to control the load within 1 pound. 【Easily instal】：lYou can install the hat rack after taking off the protective layer on a suitable wall easily and conveniently without any tools for its strong sticky. 【Various functions】：Suitable for almost all kinds of hats, including hi-hop hats, baseball hats, flat-brimmed hats, duck tongue hats, berets, cowboy hats, etc. It can be used for hanging earphone holders, sunglasses, scarves, headwear, and other items. The feature of the hatrack is hanging keys, necklaces, and other decorative items after adding a convenient hook. 【Note】：The hook is suitable for sticking on the wood, tile, plastic, metal, glass, and marble. Be cautious to stick on drywall and painted walls. It is not suitable for sticking on wallpaper and rough surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718faeDZ9pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vorceary","source_asin":"B0B3SYNC7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3SYNC7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3SYNC7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953589,"name":"Sieve Drinkware Tumblers, 20 oz, Mango Tango","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cq8NQISzL._AC_SL1042_.jpg","description":"Product Description 20 oz Sieve Tumbler(Mango Tango). Whether its crystal clear water, an ice cold soda, a stiff mixed drink, or a protein shake, its better with ice and fruit. We've made it easier to add those things.The brilliance of the Sieve Tumbler is its simplicity. Add your fruit, ice, protein powder or whatever to the bottom. Twist on the sieve. Add your drink of choice. shake if you wish. And enjoy without everything hitting you in the face.The 20 ounce Sieve Tumbler is made from BPA free Eastman Tritan Co-polyester, and is virtually indestructible. Sieve Drinkware is microwave safe and dishwasher safe (top Rack). From the Manufacturer American Made: The Sieve Tumbler is Patent Pending and was designed and produced in the USA using the highest quality standards. High Quality Sieve Tumbler is made from Eastman's \"Tritan\" copolyester, it is BPA free, dishwasher (top shelf) and microwavable safe. Sieve Drinkware products are virtually indestructible. Ice Sieve Ice Sieve The Sieve/screen is used to keep the ice in your drink from sliding upward Fruit Infuser Fruit Infuser The Sieve/screen shake the drink to infuse your favorite fruit into drink Protein Drink Shaker Protein Drink Shaker The Sieve/Screen makes a great mixer for all your protein drinks How it Works: The brilliance of the Sieve Tumbler is it’s simplicity. Add your fruit, ice, protein powder or whatever to the bottom. Twist on the sieve. Add your drink of choice. Shake if you wish. And enjoy without everything hitting you in the face. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Ingenious Multi-functional Tumbler How did you come up with the idea for this product? After mowing the lawn on a hot day I desided to have a glass of ice cold sweet ice tea. The glass was half full of ice and when I went to take a drink the ice came forward and the drink spilled down my neck. I said there must be a better way. Later that day I researched and found nothing on the market, so I made a prototype. What makes your product special? Many things, but I would say it's simplicity and being multi-fuctional is very important. What has been the best part of your startup experience? I think seeing peoples reactions after using it for the first time. They love it and it is very rewarding to know you have created something people really want and need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cq8NQISzL._AC_SL1042_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sieve Drinkware","source_asin":"B01EIL3TZE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EIL3TZE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EIL3TZE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
