window.products.push({"id":953804,"name":"Rustic Cast Iron Coat Hooks (5 Pack) Wall Mounted Farmhouse Decorative Wall Hooks, Vintage Hooks for Hanging Coats, Bags, Hats, Towels (Antique Black,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E97ioRffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"QUALITY: Unlike Other Wall Mounted Hooks or cheaply made hooks, you might find on Amazon, our Heavy Duty, Strong, Cast Iron Coat Hooks are not flimsy, cheap metal and will not bend or break when your family hangs their heavy Coats, Back Packs, or any other gear. Manufactured to be used indoor or outdoor and can stand up to the elements. Use these black hooks as Towel Hooks or Hooks for Hanging Coats (Coat Hooks Wall Mounted). VINTAGE INSPIRED: Antique Black Patina. Authentically Reproduced. My Fancy Farmhouse coat hooks are perfect for your Charming, Farmhouse, Barnhouse or Schoolhouse Shabby Chic Decor. This Item was manufactured to look antique, expect some built in imperfections, which adds to its rustic charm. Adds that perfect touch of shabby chic style to any style home. FARMHOUSE STYLE: These vintage coat hooks are both decorative and useful. Perfect accent for your entryway, mudroom, bathroom or closet wall hooks for hanging backpacks, jackets, hats, heavy garments, dog leashes, or any other gear you may have. Mount them to a rustic piece of wood or build a floating shelf combination over some mudroom cubbies. MEASUREMENTS: Height (4\"), Width (1 1/8\"), Top Hook Extends (2 1/4\") Bottom Hook Extends (1 3/4\"). Includes 10 mounting screws and anchors. Wall Hooks Heavy Duty. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: My Fancy Farmhouse, wants happy customers, so your satisfaction is our priority. If you are not 100% satisfied, after receiving your Cast Iron Hooks, for any reason, we offer a no hassle, no questions asked money back guarantee. Ships from the US!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E97ioRffL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Fancy Farmhouse","source_asin":"B09WW3L8DT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WW3L8DT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WW3L8DT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
