window.products.push({"id":953900,"name":"15 x 15 Inch Mini Fondant Mat CLEAR - Best Tool to Cover Cake with Fondant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UzOf5mRSL._AC_SL1067_.jpg","description":"THE ONLY FOOD SAFE VINYL FONDANT MAT AVAILABLE - This patent pending 2-mat system is a revolutionary way to roll out and cover cakes with fondant. Use this Food Safe tool and our method to make a Fondant cake and get professional results instantly! THE MINI MAT is CLEAR and approximately 15\" X 15\" . About THE MAT…. similar plastic or vinyl products are petroleum based and contain phthalates that are used as a plasticizer. Both are known to create health problems and concentrations of these can build in the body over time. Most if not all similar plastic products are made in China and use petroleum oil and contain phthalates and heavy metals like mercury and lead. If you unroll similar plastic products and smell the plastic, you’ll smell a strong chemical or petroleum order. If you smell THE MAT in comparison, you’ll notice a nice clean smell similar to plastic food wraps. We chose to have THE MAT manufactured in US so we could be absolutely certain that THE MAT is made of food safe materials and manufactured in a food safe environment. THE MINI MAT is made with soybean oil and other food safe components that are listed as food safe in Code of Federal Regulations. The Code of Federal Regulations (CFR) is the codification of the general and permanent rules published in the Federal Register by the executive departments and agencies of the United States Federal Government. Title 21 Sections 174 - 182 is the section of the CFR that pertains to materials and substances that are determined to be food safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UzOf5mRSL._AC_SL1067_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweet Wise","source_asin":"B009PKE5FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009PKE5FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009PKE5FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953901,"name":"Lotus Golden Brown Silicone Baking Cup Liner (Case of 100), PacknWood - Gold/Brown Parchment Paper Cupcake Liners (4 oz, 3.1\" x 1.5\") PK209CPSL3M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f0bp-o4KL._AC_.jpg","description":"Made of parchment paper, our lotus baking cups are as functional as they are attractive; an elegant presentation for all your baked goods. These baking cups fit in a standard Muffin tin and hold 4 ounces each. The baking cup is safe for use in a microwave or an oven and is biodegradable. The assembled cup has a 1.8-inch diameter, and measures 3.3-inch from the base to the tip. PacknWood is a well-established French manufacturer that specializes in the design and manufacture of elegant disposable food packaging. PacknWood offers the largest selection of plates, skewers, mini dishes, bake ware, serving-ware which are made from the most unique and natural materials: bamboo, wood, palm leaf, sugarcane and Cornstarch all with a French touch to the design and presentation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41f0bp-o4KL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PacknWood","source_asin":"B07N6YTH4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N6YTH4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N6YTH4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
