window.products.push({"id":953963,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Seersucker Duvet Cover Set, King, Mineral Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lG9bMjBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Seersucker Duvet set with two matching shams. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com Seersucker duvet set made of 200-thread-count 100% cotton. view larger Pinzon Duvet Set What You Need to Know: Made in Portugal; 200-thread-count, 100% cotton Made in Portugal; 200-thread-count, 100% cotton Solid-green seersucker top with subtly textured stripes; smooth on the reverse Solid-green seersucker top with subtly textured stripes; smooth on the reverse Matching seersucker shams with side envelope closure Matching seersucker shams with side envelope closure Machine washable Machine washable Pinzon 100-Percent-Cotton Seersucker Duvet Set Slip into luxurious living with help from this king duvet set by Pinzon. We know you work hard--it's time for a little royal treatment. Gracefully combining comfort with high-quality craftsmanship, the 200-thread-count 100-percent-cotton duvet cover features the classic seersucker stripe with its soft, rippled texture that's soothing to the touch. On the reverse side, it provides a smooth 200-thread-count percale in the same color as the front. The corresponding pillow shams come in matching seersucker fabric on both sides and offer a clean edge and a side envelope closure for easy pillow insertion or removal. Best of all, the solid green color of the duvet set allows for easily accommodating existing solid or patterned sheets, decorative throw pillows, and surrounding bedroom decor. Made in Portugal, the king duvet set includes a duvet cover measuring 106 by 92 inches and two pillow shams, measuring 20 by 36 inches. Each piece is easy to care for at home by machine washing as needed. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lG9bMjBlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00ALTDD72","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ALTDD72","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ALTDD72","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":953964,"name":"Kardiel Tripod Plywood Modern Lounge Chair, Urban Surf Twill/Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518oT3CqE1L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Tripod's arching curves and exaggerated seat lines earned the chair nicknames such as wing and smile chair. Kardiel's reproduction of the iconic mid century modern 1963 design is made in true form to the original. It is no accident that this reproduction has the most quality features, all designed to ensure long lasting service and great design. The plywood is molded to the exact curvature and dimension creating soft contours that invite you to relax and stretch your legs out. The exact back and seat tilt angle puts the sitter in the unique position originally intended. This high quality reproduction features all of the quality construction points and has the good posture of civility and solid form at a fraction of the original cost. * Heat and Pressure Molded plywood legs and body * Genuine American Oak Species * High Density low profile foam layer under seat and back * Fabric Type: Vintage Tailored Twill: 60% Linen, 20% Cotton, 20% Nylon * The wood frame has been uniformly kiln dried to a stabilized moisture level * Triple sanded wood for the smoothest possible surfaces * 5 individual coats of UV Cured hard polyurethane finish resists wear and scratches * True to original 4 flat head bolts on rear of back * Exacting reproduction details of dimensions and curves * Total Chair Dimensions: Width: 36.2\", Depth: 29.5\", Height: 29.5\", Seat Height: 17.5\" About Vintage Tailored Twill: Twill is an interwoven knit fabric. The thread takes turns in an over and under weave forming a crooked yet overall lineal rectangle pattern that can be discerned at close range. The pattern exists but appears somewhat random when viewed from a normal distance. Vintage Tailored Twill provides a more refined, tailored appearance than that of a typical coarse twill. It relies on the multi-tone nature of the fabric strands themselves to provide the appearance of depth of texture. All fabrics wear with time, however when compared to common fabrics types like boucle or felt, twill are often considered more durable as they exhibit less visible wear effects such as piling and fuzzing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518oT3CqE1L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardiel","source_asin":"B0163TT0FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-953964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0163TT0FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0163TT0FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
